    // Between the static decay and the yaw minimum, where the alphabet and the hip block's own
    // yaw pair at 0x7d4 / 0x7d8 put it: it holds Black Ops 3's value on 87 of 153 shared weapons,
    // as its neighbours do. It used to sit at 0x71c, which reads 25 on most weapons and matched 6,
    // so aiming down the sights kicked from -17 to 25 where the weapon says -17 to 17.
